ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/extras/5377fa93f25b291cdf763b95d5aa623f.poster.avif?t=1770281515\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/extras/5377fa93f25b291cdf763b95d5aa623f.webm?t=1770281515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/extras/5377fa93f25b291cdf763b95d5aa623f.mp4?t=1770281515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize between firepower and resource gathering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking tower blocks will increase the performance of the turret on the top. Every tower type has different upgrades linked to the amount and type of power supplied. As an example the missile tower does more damage when combined with gun towers, while the area of effect of the explosion is increased when combined with missile towers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively gun towers can increase a miner's primary resource gathering, while missile towers increase the gathering of the secondary resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be up to you to determine when units are used to boost the economy, or used for combat. Units can be moved to play a different role at any moment during the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/extras/73a4a4fe4cbc7d174f74793386abecb3.poster.avif?t=1770281515\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/extras/73a4a4fe4cbc7d174f74793386abecb3.webm?t=1770281515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/extras/73a4a4fe4cbc7d174f74793386abecb3.mp4?t=1770281515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single player PvE scenarios\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions are designed to challenge the player to use different tactics. The start conditions of the player and the enemy are completely different in each mission. While not fair, this setup allows for a more varied experience. Progressing through the game both sides will unlock extra units, allowing for different tactics to be used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build for VR only. With unique VR interactions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics based. Most projectiles, units and items can be grabbed by the player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > RTS basics : Base building, resources, interact with individual units, 'large' unit count, unlock new units as game progresses, fog of war.\u00a0 \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context help available to onboard the player in the first missions. (optional, can be disabled)\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free demo (already available)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Golongself"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648700/31ffffa053f285cd23ef01f811874d44b8d8d332/header.jpg?t=1770281515","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648700/1514729761/0c7bd78e24975c4d4e9478aee34a6fad7b626819/1764778816/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764792668","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai